  'Application for Vehicle Registration (Ministry of Transportation): the registrant, the plates and the vehicle status when a car is registered or changes registrant at ServiceOntario. Used for the Lease and Transfer methods, where CarmaCars or the owner''s corporation becomes the registrant. Left blank on purpose: sex and date of birth (a company registrant has none), the plates question, section 7 (the fleet insurer and policy are written at the counter), section 8''s signature (CarmaCars'' signing officer signs; no owner signature on this form) and the office-use block. Draft mapping from the official PDF (https://forms.mgcs.gov.on.ca/dataset/3c75269a-0400-4861-baf2-93a5d668f57c/resource/339a68c4-afe9-4cc8-a372-7c1665e27d14/download/sr-lv-006e.pdf, SHA-256 df4831f0bdcfc794a901f6dff79423e6982980276a3dc659edeed68162c9cc49; template 5787cd8e3721c49659c89ace32d8f06fe69c5e6ddb6a6c86392a86c333004fa2); check every field before use.');
