  'Supplementary Application (Ministry of Transportation): a car registered to two people or two companies (the Co-Registrant method: the owner and CarmaCars on the permit), and an unincorporated operating name. Left blank on purpose: sex, registrant type codes, the mailing address when it is the same as the home address, CarmaCars'' own signature in section 2 (its signing officer signs) and section 3 (no operating name is recorded). Draft mapping from the official PDF (https://forms.mgcs.gov.on.ca/dataset/65d44654-5ed9-4106-9d1a-260f5158fe27/resource/d0cb7203-79fa-4e37-bee6-869621afdad4/download/sr-lv-012e.pdf, SHA-256 75e413f4dc37d8416b44d93c4cb5b2e42cf9251d5e51e74c585d00d5c15ad0ed; template 12c4afc1adeab0cc77e42eac689322252df391f1c474bbaf8859c5d9a3fd8ad6); check every field before use.');
