  'Proof of Business Address, obtaining or amending a Registrant Identification Number (RIN): a corporation needs a RIN to be a registrant (the owner''s corporation under a Lease method). The publisher''s PDF is an Adobe dynamic form with no fillable fields, so it was laid out as a plain PDF and each value is printed in the box of its field. Left blank on purpose: the other purposes (name or address change, merge, amalgamation), whether the vehicles are kept at this address and whether the business runs from the owner''s home (the owner answers), the street number box (the street line carries the number), the province (the laid-out form already prints Ontario) and the office-use block. Draft mapping from the official PDF (https://forms.mgcs.gov.on.ca/dataset/013f8aa4-4c48-4845-973b-6ce3489dcf6a/resource/8939f879-0692-45a3-b29f-e3d57adea913/download/on00453e.pdf, SHA-256 a60e0c5d7bbb3a73b494c1767b9233e1f49e3b32bc27ff1eee1316c777d871f6; template cf4e16985ecbcc45d55c9351d31f8ecb8b780c7727a1e6929a1bbf90ec9ab904); check every field before use.');
