  'Addendum to the Sworn Statement when claiming the retail sales tax exemption on a transfer between corporations, or between a corporation and its shareholder (Ministry of Finance): with 013-1155 when an owner moves the car into their own corporation. Left blank on purpose: the province (a drop-down of the form, chosen when printed), the street number box (the street line carries it) and the relationship between seller and buyer (the owner writes it in their own words). Draft mapping from the official PDF (https://forms.mgcs.gov.on.ca/dataset/58d08d07-4c88-4409-9180-bee77a92c4da/resource/9ec64eb2-a48d-42d4-bef1-4dc87882dcf9/download/0169e.pdf, SHA-256 617765ba9bf4d2aa4ed5eb57f201b46ccfce3c40329850cc7ba6931688750233; template 711935e5fc3c3ca65974bf66c0fa95a0e806928efdf1d14cb10ec5bb1db614bc); check every field before use.');
